cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FlyEye Developer Kit or its derived graph profiles, please cite this software and preserve the MaleCNS attribution recorded in the profile manifest."
title: "FlyEye Developer Kit: reusable Drosophila connectome graphs and runtime tooling"
type: software
version: "0.5.0-alpha.9"
date-released: 2026-09-18
authors:
  - name: "FlyEye Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tubban1/fly-eye"
url: "https://fly.fde.fan"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Drosophila
  - fruit fly
  - connectome
  - MaleCNS
  - neuroscience
  - LC4
  - looming
  - escape circuit
  - graph
  - neuroinformatics
abstract: >-
  FlyEye Developer Kit provides reusable MaleCNS-derived Drosophila graph
  profiles, a binary graph parser, modeled runtime dynamics, Python tooling,
  connectome extraction tools, and compatibility benchmarks. MaleCNS-derived
  graph data retain their upstream CC BY 4.0 attribution and are explicitly
  separated from modeled dynamics.
